# Runtime package & bootstrap

- Tarball/package root: `RUNTIME_VERSION`, `SUPPORTED_COMPILERS`.
- User resolve: `--runtime=`/`--bridge=` → else extract embed → else in-tree.
- `--no-runtime` keeps bridges unless `--no-bridge`. Defaults: executable + runtime + bridges + OS syslibs.
- Release embed is two-phase: stage-1 xlang → compile frontend runtime → rebuild xlang with embed (`xmake bootstrap_embed`). Bridges (C) embed without that dance.
- Docs: `docs/RUNTIME.md`, `docs/BRIDGE_ABI.md`.
